.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "2024-01-01" "libmyutils" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a string with length limit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mystrncpy(char* dest, const char* src, int n);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrncpy
copies at most
.I n
characters from the string pointed to by
.I src
to the buffer pointed to by
.IR dest .
If
.I src
is shorter than
.IR n ,
the remaining bytes in
.I dest
are filled with null bytes.
.PP
Returns the number of characters copied.
